Assistant Professor / Associate Professor / Professors in any discipline with a minimum
of 5 years’ experience in relevant field.

The following criteria shall be considered while selecting candidates for the posts:
• Experience in industry/institutional setting or research/academic environment;
• Relevant academic qualifications;
• A high degree of integrity;
• A good record of scholarly publications;
• A demonstrated ability to motivate and inspire students;
